OL,3,GNEWSADriver, 79, dies after head-on
OL,4,Acrash with van
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 79-year-old man has died in a crash
OL,7,Fbetween a car and a van in West Hallam.
OL,9,FDerbyshire Police said the man was
OL,10,Fdriving a blue Ford Ecosport that
OL,11,Fcrossed into oncoming traffic in High
OL,12,FLane West at about 13:15 GMT on
OL,13,FWednesday and hit a brown Mercedes van.
OL,15,FThe force said the man, from the
OL,16,FIlkeston area, died at the scene and
OL,17,Fthe van driver, a man in his 50s, was
OL,18,Fhelping officers with their inquiries.
OL,20,FA road closure was in place between St
OL,21,FWilfrid's Road and Station Road but the
OL,22,Fstretch has since reopened.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
